    "# Camera student v2: learn from the curriculum teacher (C1_a3)\n",
    "\n",
    "**What this does:** retrains the camera student with DAgger, but now:\n",
    "- the **teacher is C1_a3**, the curriculum teacher. It is more reliable at home (91 % nominal vs 79 %) and drops the egg far less (39 % vs 64 % on the wide sector);\n",
    "- it **starts from your current student's weights**, not from scratch;\n",
    "- it trains on the **C1 region** (125\u2013185 mm, 51\u201380\u00b0) instead of Arc-1.5.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Why:** the camera student will later be fine-tuned on sir's new robot model. A better student checkpoint now gives a better starting point there.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Saved to a new folder,** `spirob_vision/camera_student_c1/`. Your current student in `camera_student/` is only read, never changed.\n",
    "\n",
  
   ]
  },
