    "## 2. Write the scripts\n",
    "\n",
    "These are the same two scripts as your camera-student notebook, with two additions:\n",
    "- `polar_tasks.py` gains the `Mjlab-SpiRob-Polar-C1` region;\n",
    "- `student_dagger.py` gains `--init`, which starts a new run from existing student weights (including the student's input normalisation).\n",
    "\n",
    "Sir's files are untouched."
