    "**Healthy run:**\n",
    "- `student-driven` success starts at about 40\u201350 % (the region is wider than Arc-1.5) and rises over the rounds;\n",
    "- `egg found within` stays at about 5\u20138 mm.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Stop (\u25a0) and send Claude a screenshot** if `student-driven` success is still falling by about round 4.\n",
    "\n",
